  "ingredients": [
    "1 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "2 1/2 cup erythritol",
    "5 tablespoon butter (melted)",
    "16 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "15 whole fresh mint (leaves)",
    "1/4 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "6 ounce low-carb dark chocolate",
    "1/4 teaspoon peppermint extract"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Line a square baking pan with parchment paper, leaving a little extra on each end of the pan to help remove and cut dessert later. In a large bowl, mix the almond flour and about 20% (1/5) of the powdered erythritol.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour melted butter into the bowl. Mix ingredients together until dough forms.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the dough into the baking pan. Bake dough for 8 minutes, or light brown. Remove pan from oven and set aside to cool as the crust.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a high-speed mixer, create the filling by beating the cream cheese and remaining erythritol until smooth. Set aside the cream cheese filling.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the mint leaves and heavy cream in a food processor and blend until smooth. Add the mint cream mixture to the cream cheese filling and fold in.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scoop the mint and cream cheese filling into the prepared crust. Place the pan in the freezer for 3 hours or until firm.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the excess parchment paper, carefully remove the cheesecake from the pan and slice into squares. Place the cheesecake back into the freezer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the microwave, heat chocolate in 30-second intervals, stirring frequently until thin. Add mint extract to the melted chocolate and mix thoroughly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/grasshopper-cheesecake-bites-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip or drizzle each cheesecake square in the mint chocolate and allow to cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-no-bake-grasshopper-cheesecake-bites/#wprm-recipe-52858-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
